# Windsurf MCP note (blueprint)

Windsurf's project-level MCP config location is NOT confirmed in current
official docs (the widely reported `~/.codeium/windsurf/mcp_config.json`
is user-level and unverified), so blueprint generates no Windsurf MCP
config rather than guessing a path the tool may silently ignore.

Servers declared in .blueprint/config.toml, for manual wiring wherever
this tool actually reads MCP config:

- `blueprint`: `blueprint mcp serve`
